{"4610740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Driftborn", "steam_appid": 4610740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through  a fractured world where speed is survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master fast-paced, high-speed racing on powerful creatures as you drift through sharp turns, boost across open terrain, and outmaneuver other riders in competitive races.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each creature handles differently, rewarding skill, timing, and control as you push for the perfect run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610740/extras/cf818951fb6b32e7f9ff2659d9ac44a5.avif?t=1782498538\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• High-speed creature racing with drifting and boost mechanics  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Competitive multiplayer races  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Deep creature customization and visual personalization  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Unique creature handling and movement systems  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Stylized world blending fantasy and futuristic elements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a world shaped by memory and motion, Driftborn blends a wild terrain with remnants of a lost future. Ride across shifting landscapes, uncover new paths, and become part of a world where movement is <i>everything</i>.  </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through  a fractured world where speed is survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master fast-paced, high-speed racing on powerful creatures as you drift through sharp turns, boost across open terrain, and outmaneuver other riders in competitive races.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each creature handles differently, rewarding skill, timing, and control as you push for the perfect run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610740/extras/cf818951fb6b32e7f9ff2659d9ac44a5.avif?t=1782498538\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• High-speed creature racing with drifting and boost mechanics  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Competitive multiplayer races  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Deep creature customization and visual personalization  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Unique creature handling and movement systems  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Stylized world blending fantasy and futuristic elements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a world shaped by memory and motion, Driftborn blends a wild terrain with remnants of a lost future. Ride across shifting landscapes, uncover new paths, and become part of a world where movement is <i>everything</i>.  </p>", "short_description": "Race powerful creatures through a wild, futuristic frontier. Drift, boost, and compete in fast-paced multiplayer races while customizing and evolving your own unique mount.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610740/b9a65041c4160778f7990984ac1ab2fc97d1aca8/header.jpg?t=1782498538", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610740/98d0ab34839bd57b012f5a1c04dc6dae2891d3a9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782498538", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610740/98d0ab34839bd57b012f5a1c04dc6dae2891d3a9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782498538", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul cl